              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 78.44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the third angel poured out his bowl on the rivers and the springs of water, and they turned into blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I heard the angel in charge of the waters say, “The judgements you have made are just, O Holy One, you who are and who were! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They poured out the blood of God's people and of the prophets, and so you have given them blood to drink. They are getting what they deserve!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I heard a voice from the altar saying, “Lord God Almighty! True and just indeed are your judgements!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
